I can't imagine why this is occurring unless it is new to pl184.  pl182
compiled just fine for me without any extra hackery.  This said,
though, there are probably two ways to fix your problem:

- compile with -D_BSD and link with -lbsd.  This will cause the
include files and libraries to provide the necessary structures.

- compile with -DNOWAIT3.  This will cause CAP not to try and use the
wait3() stuff.
