I've encountered this error while compiling Adobe Transcript on the Alpha.
The solution is to add -D_BSD (note the underscore) to CFLAGS. This
will cause the correct wait() to be defined in the header file
/usr/include/wait.h. This worked for me under OSF/1 v1.2a. Please let me
know how it goes 'cos sooner or later I'll need to run CAP on our Alpha
box as well.

Andy
