Hm, just a calculated guess :

You received the system factory-installed, but have a standard HX graphics
board.

If so, deinstall Open3D ( the O3Dxxxx subsets ). Open3d is also factory
installed, but it contains the X Server for the 3D accelerators.

Deinstalling it should do the trick. In fact, if you look in your
/usr/bin/X11 directory you will see symbolic links there, pointing
/usr/bin/X11/X ( which is the X server configured in xdm ) to the
actual X Server binary. Probably yours is pointing to the 3D version
